<object type="4" symbol="190" h_align="0" v_align="2"><coords count="1">-194094 251357;</coords><text>Edit, only if you created a new map or 
total remap. Do not change for minor updates.
Leave credit to those whom put in hundreds of
hours of work. We should not forget them----------&gt; 
</text></object>
<object type="4" symbol="190" h_align="0" v_align="2"><coords count="1">-194082 233549;</coords><text>Edit, only if you make any of these 
changes. Very helpful for the next mapper----------&gt;</text></object>
<object type="4" symbol="190" h_align="0" v_align="2"><coords count="1">-193925 217440;</coords><text>Always Edit, new release date, 
version, what you did and your name. Generally 
this will mean you added a trail or point feature.
Add you name to the History Panel -------------------&gt;</text></object>
